{
  "folder": "PVM9xBt9UzTWTWGT",
  "name": "Midnight Streets",
  "type": "environment",
  "img": "modules/cybermancy/assets/images/environments/Midnight%20streets.png",
  "system": {
    "description": "<p>The streets at 2 a.m. pulse with the faint afterglow of a city that never quite sleeps but has slumped into a dangerous lull. Neon signage flickers above empty walkways, casting jittery light across rain-sheened pavement. Delivery drones buzz through narrow flight lanes overhead. The transit grid runs on skeleton power, so half the intersections operate on fallback patterns, leaving certain lanes plunged in darkness. Steam rises from cracked vents. The few citizens still awake move fast and keep their heads down.</p>",
    "tier": 1,
    "difficulty": 13,
    "potentialAdversaries": {},
    "notes": "<p><strong>Environment: Midnight Arterials</strong></p><p>The streets at 2 a.m. pulse with the faint afterglow of a city that never quite sleeps but has slumped into a dangerous lull. Neon signage flickers above empty walkways, casting jittery light across rain-sheened pavement. Delivery drones buzz through narrow flight lanes overhead. The transit grid runs on skeleton power, so half the intersections operate on fallback patterns, leaving certain lanes plunged in darkness. Steam rises from cracked vents. The few citizens still awake move fast and keep their heads down.</p>",
    "impulses": "",
    "type": "event",
    "attribution": {}
  },
