    {
      "name": "Police in Pursuit",
      "type": "feature",
      "system": {
        "description": "<p><strong>Spend 2 Fear</strong> to add a police cruiser to the chase in pursuit of the chase.</p><p></p><p>Their Chase die starts at the highest value and they can be spotlighted like normal. If they get within range, they will warn all participants in the chase to stop.</p><p></p><p>Start a <strong>Progress Countdown (4)</strong>. It ticks down whenever a party member takes an action.</p><p></p><p><strong>If this Progress Countdown reaches 0</strong>, add another Police cruiser to the chase and the police begin to open fire. <br /><br /><strong>Attack: </strong>+1 | Heavy Pistol | Close | 1d6+2</p>",
