    {
      "name": "Short cut",
      "type": "feature",
      "system": {
        "description": "<p>Any player character who is <strong>Driving</strong> can <strong>Spend 2 Hope</strong> to attempt a short cut through the alley. <strong>Make a Driving (15) check:</strong></p><p></p><ul><li><p><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;scrollbar-width:thin;scrollbar-color:var(--color-scrollbar) var(--color-scrollbar-track);font-family:Montserrat, sans-serif\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box;scrollbar-width:thin;scrollbar-color:var(--color-scrollbar) var(--color-scrollbar-track)\">Critical Success</strong>: Chase ends immediately successfully for the players</span></p></li><li><p><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;scrollbar-width:thin;scrollbar-color:var(--color-scrollbar) var(--color-scrollbar-track);font-family:Montserrat, sans-serif\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box;scrollbar-width:thin;scrollbar-color:var(--color-scrollbar) var(--color-scrollbar-track)\">Success with Hope</strong>: Tick up 3</span></p></li><li><p><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;scrollbar-width:thin;scrollbar-color:var(--color-scrollbar) var(--color-scrollbar-track);font-family:Montserrat, sans-serif\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box;scrollbar-width:thin;scrollbar-color:var(--color-scrollbar) var(--color-scrollbar-track)\">Success with Fear</strong>: Tick up 2</span></p></li><li><p><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;scrollbar-width:thin;scrollbar-color:var(--color-scrollbar) var(--color-scrollbar-track);font-family:Montserrat, sans-serif\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box;scrollbar-width:thin;scrollbar-color:var(--color-scrollbar) var(--color-scrollbar-track)\">Failure with Hope</strong>: Tick up 1</span></p></li><li><p><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;scrollbar-width:thin;scrollbar-color:var(--color-scrollbar) var(--color-scrollbar-track);font-family:Montserrat, sans-serif\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box;scrollbar-width:thin;scrollbar-color:var(--color-scrollbar) var(--color-scrollb